Description: One catalog, one download function and a few helpers to read,
    weight and locate ten Peruvian official data sources: ENAHO, ENDES, ENA, EPEN, ENAPRES, ENUT, ENARES
    and the Annual Economic Survey from INEI, the School Census from
    MINEDU (ESCALE) and the 2017 National Censuses. Files are cached and
    checked with SHA-256, and new survey years are detected from the INEI
    microdata portal. This package is independent and is not affiliated
    with INEI or MINEDU.
